<title>USA: Yalobusha Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</title>
<headline>Yalobusha Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan Williams, Inc., said it won $2 million of Yalobusha Cty, Miss., general hospital bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.41 percent.</p>
</text>
